+"""
+Worker process that polls DB for queued QPU jobs and executes via adapters.
+ - Implements retries/backoff, updates job state, and records billing actual_cost.
+ - For PoC uses local qiskit_adapter; production adapters for AWS Braket / Pennylane are pluggable.
